[statement]
Taking a dependency every candidate shares does not decide the name: `kw`,
which every candidate for `v` needs, is installed first, but `v` waits its
turn after `u`, which `r1` answers; `r1` provides `v` too, so neither `p1`
nor `p2` is installed.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:u v

P:p1
V:1
p:v
k:100
D:kw

P:p2
V:1
p:v
k:10
D:kw

P:r1
V:1
p:u v
k:100
D:kw

P:r2
V:1
p:u
k:10

P:kw
V:1


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1
install r1 1
install app 1
